52
00:05:15.397 --> 00:05:21.217
the British Isles. I was also familiar with popular works from the Continent and paid close attention to the tastes of

53
00:05:21.218 --> 00:05:26.964
the day. Competition on the London theatrical scene was quite fierce, but my company

54
00:05:26.965 --> 00:05:32.980
thrived. FAYE MOSS: You even performed for many powerful people in your day. What was

55
00:05:32.981 --> 00:05:42.460
that like? WILLIAM SHAKESPEARE: At times it was inconvenient! One night we were hired to give a performance of The Comedy of Errors for a group

56
00:05:42.461 --> 00:05:50.696
