had plans! After performing for the queen, we arrived very late to our second engagement, creating much

58
00:05:57.349 --> 00:06:05.858
ado! It was nearly midnight, and by then the stage had been dismantled. The entire affair became called "The Night of Errors."

59
00:06:05.859 --> 00:06:14.618
FAYE MOSS: Queen Elizabeth wasn't the only monarch you performed for. Later your company had a royal

